  <NAME>Chromatin and gene-regulatory dynamics of the developing human cerebral cortex at single-cell resolution</NAME>
  <TITLE>Chromatin and gene-regulatory dynamics of the developing human cerebral cortex at single-cell resolution</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>In this study, we map chromatin accessibility and gene expression at single-cell resolution in the developing human cerebral cortex. Overall design: We generated single-cell ATAC-seq and single-cell RNA-seq libraries from 4 samples of mid-gestation human cerebral cortex, spanning 8 weeks of development **RAW DATA not provided due to patient privacy**</DESCRIPTION>
